 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【欧冠战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/match1944222date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进军决赛！巴黎1-1总分6-5拜仁将战阿森纳 登贝莱闪击凯恩破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260507/zhanbao_image_1944222_1778101114_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260507/zhanbao_image_1944222_1778101114_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260507/zhanbao_image_1944222_1778101114_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">拜仁主场1-1战平巴黎，总比分巴黎6-5淘汰拜仁连续两年晋级欧冠决赛，将于5月31日对阵阿森纳。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fb664f9d8bfnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">⚔决战布达佩斯！欧冠决赛对阵：巴黎vs阿森纳，5月31日00:00开打</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/69fb6886a98c3.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/69fb6886a98c3.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/69fb6886a98c3.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">欧冠半决赛次回合全部战罢，决赛对阵正式出炉！巴黎圣日耳曼将与阿森纳争夺本赛季欧冠冠军奖杯。</span></p><p><strong><span style=" 0, 0);">【赛后声音】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fbb39ed5c7dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">莱默尔：裁判吹我先手球太离谱 四官什么时候可以介入判罚了？</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fbb155263danative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">诺伊尔：我们在巴黎不够高效，而今晚则未能创造绝对得分机会</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fbc43ddfba4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">基米希：我们本赛季一共就输了三场球，所以失望感才会这么强烈</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fbb7f54b135native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">内维斯禁区手球未判点，塔：必须有人来给我解释这次手球判罚</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.53" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260507/202605070646533079.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.53" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.53" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260507/202605070646533079.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260507/202605070646533079.jpg"> </div><p>拜仁将帅在赛后接受采访，表达了无缘决赛的失望之情。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fbb1f617b2fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">帕乔：很开心能再次打进欧冠决赛 我们后卫和前锋之间相互帮助</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fbb7f7158fbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">杜埃：今天巴黎的防守做得非常好，和阿森纳的决赛会很艰难</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fbc4ab992cenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">恩里克：拜仁的足球水平极高 马上就是我的生日了我现在很开心</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fbba568ccc3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">恩里克：巴黎像天使一样在防守，我们确实配得上晋级</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260507/202605070646255366.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260507/202605070646255366.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260507/202605070646255366.jpg"> </div><p>巴黎将帅也在赛后接受了采访，展望和阿森纳之间的欧冠决赛。</p><p><strong>【其他新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fbb5a0613cenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">门德斯手球未吃第2黄！正面视角：莱默尔腹部触球 手臂无明显接触</a></p><p><span style=" 0, 0);">拜仁vs巴黎第29分钟，门德斯用手臂拦下皮球，裁判吹罚莱默尔手球犯规，给了巴黎任意球。此前门德斯已经有黄牌在身。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fb725e3e084native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马卡：巴尔韦德和琼阿梅尼在训练中几乎大打出手，一直吵到更衣室</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/202605070055001133.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/202605070055001133.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/202605070055001133.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">据《马卡报》报道和多家媒体的确认，目前皇马内部的紧张气氛已经达到了白热化阶段，在今日的训练课上，巴尔韦德和琼阿梅尼在一次激烈的争吵后几乎要大打出手。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fb66c30445dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">要复刻？去年巴黎附加赛晋级最终夺冠，今年附加赛晋级已进决赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/69f16a7a9f7e4.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/69f16a7a9f7e4.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/69f16a7a9f7e4.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">本赛季，巴黎欧冠联赛阶段同样通过附加赛晋级，淘汰赛先后击败切尔西，利物浦以及如今的拜仁，决赛与阿森纳争冠。巴黎会上演同样的剧情吗？</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fb5de4cda04native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">复仇之战！阿森纳上赛季欧冠遭巴黎淘汰，如今决赛巅峰再会</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fb704bce805native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">最强的矛PK最硬的盾！巴黎16场44球场均2.75个，阿森纳9零封丢6球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/69fb6886a98c3.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/69fb6886a98c3.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/69fb6886a98c3.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">阿森纳在本赛季欧冠一路不败杀入决赛，此番巅峰之战再会，阿森纳、巴黎，谁将笑到最后？</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fb704d25754native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧冠+金球双卫冕？登贝莱本赛季19球10助，连续两年进欧冠决赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260117/696aef7d90ceb.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260117/696aef7d90ceb.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260117/696aef7d90ceb.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">登贝莱去年带领巴黎首夺欧冠冠军，个人也获得2025年的金球奖和国际足联年度最佳球员。如果能率领巴黎卫冕欧冠，登贝莱也有望卫冕金球。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fb7f82e7425native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧冠决赛参赛次数：皇马18次居首，巴黎3次，阿森纳2次</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/202605070158356908_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/202605070158356908_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/202605070158356908_720.jpg"> </div><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fb935832412native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">这下真尴尬了...姆巴佩24年从巴黎去皇马，巴黎2年内连进欧冠决赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251220/6946370f97579.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251220/6946370f97579.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251220/6946370f97579.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">自从姆巴佩离队之后，巴黎已经连续2个赛季挺进欧冠决赛，去年他们在决赛中大胜国米夺得队史首个欧冠，今年他们将在决赛中对阵阿森纳。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fb5c16d55bbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">凯恩出局，K77还差5球！打进15球的姆巴佩基本锁定本赛季欧冠金靴</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.45" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/202605070507081288.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.45" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.45" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/202605070507081288_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/202605070507081288_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">考虑到本赛季欧冠只剩最后一场决赛，姆巴佩已经非常接近获得本赛季的欧冠金靴。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-07/69fbaf88661f4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">拜仁欧冠出局无缘冲击第7冠！米兰继续独占7冠，稳坐第二把交椅</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.52" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/69fbafde3db07.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.52" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; di